// Production Incident Simulator — 20 named dbt incidents (Iter 4).
// Each incident drives a multi-step on-call flow:
//   briefing -> evidence (walk the lineage) -> hypothesis (scored) -> root cause ->
//   recovery choice (scored, with consequences) -> fix -> validate -> postmortem.
// Schema: { id, icon, title, severity, paged, symptom, trace[{node,check}],
//   hypotheses[{id,label,correct,why}] (one correct), root,
//   recovery{prompt,options[{id,label,correct,outcome}]} (one correct),
//   fixCode (illustrative, NOT executed), validate,
//   writeup{cause,impact,detection,resolution,prevention}, deeper{id,label} }.
// Authored in two batches, schema-checked and de-duplicated. Adapter-specific
// behavior (incremental strategies, partition pruning, QUALIFY) is called out.
